# Jak 1, 0.1.8 (LIST-0.1.8 item 9, a tester: "shadows on all 3 are still rendered differently for each eye"). Run with
# JAKVR_TEST_CONTINUE=village1-hut and JAKVR_SHADOW_EYES=1: a new game, then Sandover by day; Jak stands still in first
# person and the player looks ahead, then down at his shadow (pitched 50 and 75 degrees), with the head lowered and
# raised a little, then turned; both eyes' pictures at each, to compare the shadow in the left and right eye. Then the
# head never still, as a player's: looking down and turning from side to side (head_yaw_rate), Jak walking a little,
# the head nodding too; "[vr] shadow in each eye" compares how much of each eye the shadows cover, every frame.
